; Endless items
; Infinite buys, unlocked at prestige level 10 once all standard upgrades are purchased. base_cost 1, cost_multiplier 1.01 (each purchase costs a little more).

endlesspassivemenu:endless_cookie_multiplier:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:An infinite 1% boost to all cookie production. Stacks with every purchase.
endlesspassivemenu:endless_coin_multiplier:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:An infinite 1% boost to all money earned from selling cookies. Stacks with every purchase.
endlesspassivemenu:endless_baking_slot_discount:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:An infinite 1% discount on auto baking slots, manual baking slots, and automating a slot. Stacks with every purchase, up to 90% off in total.
endlesspassivemenu:endless_boost_slot_discount:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:An infinite 1% discount on boost slots and activating boosts. Stacks with every purchase, up to 90% off in total.
endlesspassivemenu:endless_boost_power:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:An infinite 1% boost to the strength of every boost. Stacks with every purchase.
endlesspassivemenu:endless_boost_duration:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:An infinite 1% boost to how long every boost you activate lasts. Stacks with every purchase.
endlessheadstartmenu:endless_starting_coins:1:1.01:10:false:true:10000:Begin each run with an extra $100.00 in your pocket.
endlessheadstartmenu:endless_starting_autocookie:1:1.01:10:false:true:150:Begin each run with an extra 150 auto cookies already baked in.
endlessheadstartmenu:endless_starting_manualcookie:1:1.01:10:false:true:150:Begin each run with an extra 150 manual cookies ready to go.
endlessheadstartmenu:endless_starting_auto_slots:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:Begin each run with an extra auto baking slot, already bought and automated.
endlessheadstartmenu:endless_starting_manual_slots:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:Begin each run with an extra manual baking slot, already bought.
endlessheadstartmenu:endless_starting_boost_slots:1:1.01:10:false:true:1:Begin each run with an extra boost slot, already bought.
